G("Algebra","Difficult",VP,2026,"A baker sells different types of cakes in his shop. Every small cake costs $x and every large cake costs $(2x + 3). The cost of 3 small lemon cakes and 2 large lemon cakes is $16.36. What is the cost of one small lemon cake?",["$1.91","$1.48","$2.34","None of these"],"B","3x + 2(2x+3) = 7x + 6 = 16.36 → x = 1.48.",note=N),
